# Local Node version manager hint is committed; per-user editor state is not.
.claude/

# The engineering worklog stays on the machine it was written on.
# It quotes conversations and product decisions verbatim, which is fine for
# working notes and not fine in a repository anyone else can read.
WORKPROGRESS.md
WORKPROGRESS.local.md
*.worklog.md
